{"title":"Dough/5","sourceTitle":"Dough/5/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A massa pode ser assada diretamente em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bread\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bread\">bread</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bread\" title=\"Bread\"> </a></span> ou usada para criar um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/pie\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/pie\">pie</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pie\" title=\"Pie\"> </a></span>. Para transformar a massa em pão, basta colocá-la numa <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/clay_oven\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/clay oven\">clay oven</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clay_oven\" title=\"Clay oven\"> </a></span> aquecida. Para transformar a massa em massa de torta, coloque-a sobre uma <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Wooden_table\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Wooden table\">tabel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Wooden_table\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wooden table\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120028\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 85/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 524/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 160/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.084      1 -total\n 94.11%    1.020      4 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183822-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111120028 and revision id 397441. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397441,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Dough%2F5%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T12:00:29.488Z"}